  "description": "COHDAG crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H64 Dy4 N20 O20,11(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.555-3.894 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.04-116.24°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C84H86Dy4N20O31. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
